      "content": "but it's not just \"despair\". it's facts. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person who can be fixed. i just see the damage i've caused. it feels like the only logical thing to do is to just stop causing it. stay out of everyone's way. isn't it more compassionate to just let go than to keep hurting people?",
